<id/doc/doc_socotrine_aloes/#concept> a <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E55_Type>, skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Socotrine Aloes"@en ;
    skos:broader <id/grp/grp_drugs_medicinal_botanicals/#concept> ;
    skos:definition "(GER. *Sucotrinaloe*. DU. *Sucotrinaloe*. DA. and SW. *Sokotrinaloe*. FR. *Aloes succotrin*, ou *chicotin*. IT. *Aloe succotrina*. SR. *Acibar cicotrina*. PORT. *Azevre succotrina*. LAT. *Aloe succotrina*.) See ALOES. [Thomas Mortimer (rev. Dickinson), A General Commercial Dictionary (1823), scan p. 936]"@en ;
    skos:inScheme <id/scheme/#resource> ;
    skos:notation "doc_socotrine_aloes" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Socotrine Aloes"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Document-attested minor 19th-century commodity absent as a standalone line in Layer-1 British/Canadian customs ledgers; typically subsumed under htc:0122 (Drugs Unenumerated). Attested in: Thomas Mortimer (rev. Dickinson), A General Commercial Dictionary (1823), scan p. 936, P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 507."@en ;
    <ontology/attestationBasis/#resource> "document_attested" ;
